  "body": "What should we do when the coding is unsupported? As far as I can see from the spec it is currently impossible for the user to determine whether a payload has been decoded or not.\r\n\r\nThe only reasonable thing I can think of at the moment as an implementer is to error the response. Unless I have some other way of notifying the consumer that the data is not decoded.\r\n\r\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/954#discussion_r688416679",
